<x-layout title="About"><x-page-heading title="A night built around the track" intro="A fictional meeting with a real sense of occasion: open, exacting and charged by a shared crowd." /><section class="editorial section"><img src="{{ config('event.images.track') }}" alt="Track under stadium lights"><div><p class="eyebrow">The concept</p><h2>Big performances, close to the people.</h2><p>Aurora is imagined as an annual summer gathering for athletes, supporters and a new generation of competitors. Its format puts competition in the foreground and makes room for everyone around it.</p><p>From an early community programme to an elite night session, the meeting makes the stadium feel like one continuous stage.</p></div></section><section class="section columns"><div><p class="eyebrow">Our story</p><h2>Made to travel.</h2></div><div><p>This demonstration brand is intentionally location-flexible. The venue, date, partners and operational information can be replaced in one central event file.</p><p>It has been shaped with the visual rhythm of established international meetings: an editorial pace, direct practical information and a respect for athletics itself.</p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Organizer</p><h3>Aurora Event Studio</h3><p>Illustrative meeting organizers, working across sport, culture and city events.</p></div></section><section class="photo-quote" style="background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(8,16,28,.78),rgba(8,16,28,.1)),url('{{ config('event.images.field') }}')"><blockquote>“The best meetings make a stadium feel like the centre of the city.”</blockquote></section></x-layout>
